Schedule pickups, assign vehicles, scan at pickup.

41
00:03:19.997 --> 00:03:21.256
Hub operations:

42
00:03:21.536 --> 00:03:26.656
Inbound scan, sortation (manual or automated), bagging, outbound manifests.

43
00:03:26.936 --> 00:03:28.387
Line-haul or TMS:

44
00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:33.595
Trips between hubs: vehicles, routes, schedules, loading, tracking, e-way bills.

45
00:03:34.945 --> 00:03:35.862
Last mile:

46
