47
00:03:43.419 --> 00:03:44.913
NDR and RTO:

48
00:03:45.193 --> 00:03:49.886
Failed delivery handling, re-attempts, customer contact, returns to origin.

49
00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:51.446
Reverse logistics:

50
