371
00:30:27.716 --> 00:30:32.623
Key metrics: on-time delivery by lane and client;. first-attempt delivery rate;.

372
00:30:33.973 --> 00:30:42.229
RTO rate;. cost per shipment (first mile, hub, line-haul, last mile);. hub throughput and sorter utilisation;. trip fill rate;.

373
00:30:42.509 --> 00:30:46.733
